y like never before.\n\nCrane Ops is an advanced VR Simulation Game that puts you in full control of a wide range of Industrial Cranes and Construction Machines from towering high-rise rigs to cmpact mobile units and forklifts.\nWhether you're a professional Operator, a Trainee, or simply fascinated by the mechanics of lifting and logistics, Crane Ops delivers a fully immersive, hands-on experience that combines real-world physics with rich, interactive environments.\n\nFeatures:\nOperate multiple crane types: Tower, Fork Lifter, Telescopic and more.\nRealistic Environments: Construction Sites, Ports, Warehouses, and Training Yards.\nAuthentic controls and real-life physics simulation.\nProgressive challenges and certification-style missions.\nBuilt for Gamers, Trainers, and Industry Professionals.\nStep into the Cab. Take the Controls. Master the Machinery.\nMultiplayer co-op modes for team-based logistics and crane coordination. (Coming Soon).", "short_description": "Crane Ops is the ultimate all-in-one VR Simulator for Crane and Heavy Machinery operations. Master tower cranes, mobile rigs, forklifts, and more all in hyper-realistic environments built for both Training and Immersive Gameplay."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_